[00:10.64]1. Jehovah, dear Father,
[00:15.00]There seemed no hope for us.
[00:19.48]The ransom has given
[00:23.56]Hope to ev’ryone!
[00:27.92]We give our lives to you,
[00:32.70]Our best in all we do.
[00:37.58]And we’ll tell others too,
[00:41.46]That your will might be done.
[00:45.32](Chorus)
[00:46.12]You gave your precious Son,
[00:49.94]And now we sing as one,
[00:54.46]A song we’ll sing forever,
[00:59.52]for giving us your precious Son.
[01:09.62]2. Your kindness, your mercy,
[01:14.36]They draw us close to you.
[01:18.80]Your great name, your friendship,
[01:22.88]These we’ve come to love.
[01:27.68]But something more than this
[01:32.02]Is your most precious gift.
[01:36.94]He died that we might live.
[01:40.92]You sent him from above.
[01:44.48](Chorus)
[01:45.36]You gave your precious Son,
[01:49.10]And now we sing as one,
[01:53.78]A song we’ll sing forever,
[01:59.02]for giving us your precious Son.
[02:06.18](Ending)
[02:06.34]Jehovah, dear Father, we pray in gratitude.
[02:06.42]We offer our thanks for giving us your precious Son.
